diff --git a/evidence/program-construct-map.md b/evidence/program-construct-map.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..f3a36fd7e960e1f4bb71be8c6ae5c68384503d86
--- /dev/null
+++ b/evidence/program-construct-map.md
@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
+# `solution.mpy` construct-to-semantics map
+
